      "en": "About 40% of daily actions are habits, not conscious decisions",
      "es": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]",
      "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
    },
    {
      "en": "Habits form when behaviors move from the prefrontal cortex to the basal ganglia",
